    "title": "Azure DevOps read-only tools",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Read-only lookups in Azure DevOps for Agentic SDLC agents. Use them to ground proposals in existing records. These tools cannot create or modify anything; changes are proposed in the agent's output and published only after human approval."
  },
